eping** from **2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.**, which is:\n\n$$\n2:38 - 2:15 = 23 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\n- So, she **did not sleep for 23 minutes** during the night.\n\n---\n\n### **4. Total Sleep Time That Day:**\n\n$$\n475 \\text{ minutes (in bed)} - 23 \\text{ minutes (not sleeping)} = 452 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{452} \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\nKim slept on her bed for **452 minutes** that day.", "decode_seconds": 6.783449554815888, "draft_calls": 131, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 139, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "24bc7558727ef402b14a27b261991c46b2c91ac2e701156ea75574b8beb9e40c", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "825cf61858ba6d0219733e947981fdbdd627b0e6d45263591f9677825c152b84", "output_tokens": 493, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 21646648832, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 21862809600, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1695cf1a111991fc", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 2362.838323354721, "prefill_full_target": 38.31001663208008, "prefill_relay": 0.3666880130767822, "relay": 30.124735981225967, "unattributed_runtime": 124.19858668744564, "verification_full_target": 4227.611204147339}, "proposal_lengths": [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 2], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "452", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 6.783449554815888, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 21862809600, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 21841838080, "sampling_seed": 5993651088019953431, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 131, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0, "turn_index": 0, "verify_count": 131}
